// Initialize a variable to hold the sum of even numbers
int sumOfEvens = 0;

// Loop through each element in the array
for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    // Check if the current element is even
    if (arr[i] % 2 == 0) {
        // Add the even number to the running total
        sumOfEvens += arr[i];
    }
}
```

